      "viral tweet",
      "blowing up",
      "went viral",
      "going viral",
      "while (i|i've|ive) (have|got) (you|y'?all|your attention)",
      "since this (blew up|is blowing up|took off|went viral)",
      "shameless(ly)? plug",
      "self[- ]?promo",
      "check out my",
      "check my",
      "go (follow|subscribe|check)",
      "follow me",
      "follow (me )?for (more|part \\d+|daily|updates|the rest)",
      "subscribe to my",
      "link in (my )?bio",
      "support (me|my)",
      "use (my )?code",
      "discount code",
      "promo code",
      "pre-?order",
      "out now",
      "available now",
      "on sale",
      "my (new )?(shop|store|book|album|single|ep|podcast|channel|newsletter|game|app|merch|course|website|site|art|prints|commissions)",
